            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "content"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The first step in the production of nitric acid is the combustion of ammonia:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "w7a29sfb0qhzzuy",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "w9lij1169ysg6ep",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "rntxw7itiwvbrp1",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "4\\;{\\mathrm{NH}}_3(g)\\;+\\;5\\;{\\mathrm O}_2(g)\\;\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\;4\\;\\mathrm{NO}(g)\\;+\\;6\\;{\\mathrm H}_2\\mathrm O(g)",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "(a)"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Write the equations that relate the rates of consumption of the reactants, the rates of formation of the products, and the rate of reaction."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "si1whwkfgegmrn2",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The rate of reaction is related to the rates for the consumption of reactants and formation of products according to the stoichiometry of the reaction:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "dsvxz8skq68wgnh",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "tigf9mvq2dp2f6x",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "hzlvvbo9hr1zqcw",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Rate}\\;\\mathrm{of}\\;\\mathrm{reaction}=-\\frac14\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm{NH}}_3\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}=-\\frac15\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm O}_2\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}=\\frac14\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack\\mathrm{NO}\\rbrack} {\\mathrm\\Delta t}=\\frac16\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\mathrm O\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Negative signs have been added to the reactant rates because they are decreasing; the product rates are already positive because they are increasing."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "m1if7tni3xg2epy",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "(b)"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " At 15.0 minutes after the start of a particular experiment, the instantaneous rate of reaction of NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is determined to be 3.72 × 10"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "−4"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " M/s. What is the instantaneous rate of reaction of O"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " at this time?"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "ejh37vsxta6xn6n",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "From the equation relating the rates above, we know the rates of reaction of NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and O"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " are related by:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "iuqye1apki92fay",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "8uvlwpo4rggel2s",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "a17uqkxs4utk747",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "-\\frac14\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm{NH}}_3\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}\\; =\\;-\\frac15\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm O}_2\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Solving for the rate of O"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " reaction and substituting in the rate of NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " reaction gives:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "j0em2met1qetsex",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "671bvtnapls0jo0",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "6hce4iinkp3jn7y",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm O}_2\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}\\;=\\;\\frac54\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm{NH}}_3\\rbrack} {\\mathrm\\Delta t}\\;=\\;\\frac54\\left(3.72\\times10^{-4}\\;\\mathrm M/\\mathrm s\\right)\\;=\\;4.65\\times10^{-4}\\;\\mathrm M/\\mathrm s",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We can also arrive at this result by noting that the reaction stoichiometry indicates that the rate of O"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " reaction is 5/4 the rate of NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " reaction."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "iovd2f5vesr3ta5",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "(c)"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " What is the instantaneous reaction rate at 15.0 min for the experiment in (b)?"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "w15fjr8x48gx83l",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We can use any of the reactants or products and the rate above to determine the reaction rate. For example, using the rate of NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", we have:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "eyvd4agy9f8qbzt",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "02qxp711w6o0zjp",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "a9kk9ogfsqmbhpo",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Reaction}\\;\\mathrm{rate}=-\\frac14\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack{\\mathrm{NH}}_3\\rbrack}{\\mathrm\\Delta t}=\\frac14\\left(3.72\\times10^{-4}\\;\\mathrm M/\\mathrm s\\right)=9.30\\times10^{-5}\\;\\mathrm M/\\mathrm s",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "4109142272",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "id": "1356320465",
